# SYNTHESISED to exercise the raw log's per-level marking: every other
# fixture in this repo is TRACE and DEBUG throughout, which is what a real
# TF_LOG capture looks like, so none of them can show the two levels the raw
# log marks. This file carries one line of each level the scanner
# recognises, plus a multi-line ERROR entry -- the case that decides whether
# a marking follows the entry or only its first line. The RPC span is
# modelled on testdata/provider-rpc.log's "Received downstream response"
# shape so the file still parses as a log with spans in it. Values are
# invented; no line here is from a real run.
